{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49428","headline":"临江仙 四 · 牛希济","name":"临江仙 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"江绕黄陵春庙闲，娇莺独语关关。\n满庭重叠绿苔斑。\n阴云无事，四散自归山。\n箫鼓声稀香烬冷，月娥敛尽弯环。\n风流皆道胜人间。\n须知狂客，判死爲红颜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"牛希济","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49428.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49428","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}